  "project_description": "Adds a computed base field named 'breadcrumbs' to every content entity type. Reading the field builds the entity's breadcrumb trail (via Drupal's own breadcrumb builders) and returns it as a list of link items (uri + title), so the trail can be consumed as data over JSON:API/REST, in Views, or in code without rendering the page. Absolute URLs by default, switchable to relative in the module settings.",
